</nav>

<!-- PAGE HERO -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <svg class="page-hero-bg" viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none">
    <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="190" stroke="#C8941A" stroke-width="0.6"/>
    <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="130" stroke="#C8941A" stroke-width="0.6"/>
    <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="70" stroke="#C8941A" stroke-width="0.6"/>
    <polygon points="200,80 220,190 340,200 220,210 200,320 180,210 60,200 180,190" fill="none" stroke="#C8941A" stroke-width="0.5"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">✦ &nbsp; About Us</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title">Vedic wisdom<br/>for <em>modern lives</em></h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Ask Astro Raja was built for Tamil Nadu - for students uncertain about their future, parents seeking clarity for their children, and professionals looking for direction rooted in something deeper than career advice alone.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION -->
<section class="mission-grid">
  <div class="mission-img-wrap">
    <img class="mission-img-main"
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?w=720&h=1000&fit=crop&crop=top"
      alt="Astro Raja"/>
    <img class="mission-img-accent"
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621592484082-4b9d2a36e3b6?w=420&h=440&fit=crop&crop=top"
      alt="Consultation"/>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="mission-label">Our Mission</div>
    <h2 class="mission-title">Making authentic<br/>astrology <em>accessible</em></h2>
    <p class="mission-body">For generations, Vedic astrology guidance in Tamil Nadu was accessible only through trusted family astrologers - a dying practice as families move to cities and that chain of knowledge breaks. Ask Astro Raja was created to fill that gap.</p>
    <p class="mission-body">We are not a replacement for human wisdom. We are a bridge - a way to get meaningful, Vedic-grounded guidance at any time, tailored to your actual situation, available to anyone with a phone.</p>
    <blockquote class="mission-quote">"Astrology does not define your fate. It reveals the terrain - and you choose the path."</blockquote>
    <p class="mission-body">Every report is generated fresh using your exact Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra combination - not a recycled daily horoscope, but a reading shaped by your struggles, your goals, and your life today.</p>
    <a href="/v3/get-reading" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:12px;">Begin Your Reading</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="values-section">
  <div class="section-label">What We Stand For</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Our three <em>principles</em></h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Every design decision in this tool - from the questions we ask to the language of the report - is shaped by these three commitments.</p>
  <div class="values-grid">
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="value-icon">📿</span>
      <h3 class="value-title">Authentic, Not Generic</h3>
      <p class="value-desc">We use your precise Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra - not just your zodiac sign. A Meenam person with Thulam Lagnam and Revathi star gets a fundamentally different reading from a Meenam with Mesham Lagnam and Punarpoosam. That specificity is everything.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="value-icon">🔒</span>
      <h3 class="value-title">Private by Design</h3>
      <p class="value-desc">Your name, birth details, and personal struggles are used only to generate your report. We do not store your data, build profiles on users, or share information with third parties. Your reading is yours alone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="value-icon">🌿</span>
      <h3 class="value-title">Grounded, Not Superstitious</h3>
      <p class="value-desc">Our reports offer guidance and reflection - not predictions or fear. We deliberately avoid language like "this month will be bad" or "you must do this ritual." Every report is written to empower, not to create dependency.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
<section class="audience-section">
  <div class="section-label">Who We Serve</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Built for <em>real people</em><br/>in real situations</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Ask Astro Raja was designed with four types of users in mind - each with different questions, different pressures, and different needs from a guidance tool.</p>
  <div class="audience-grid">
    <div class="audience-card">
      <img class="audience-avatar"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529626455594-4ff0802cfb7e?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Student"/>
      <div>
        <div class="audience-role">Students</div>
        <div class="audience-name">Facing the crossroads</div>
        <p class="audience-desc">After Class 12 or degree completion, the pressure to choose the "right" path is immense. Our report helps students understand their natural strengths and where their Nakshatra energy aligns - giving them language to discuss their choices with parents.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="audience-card">
      <img class="audience-avatar"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531123897727-8f129e1688ce?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Parent"/>
      <div>
        <div class="audience-role">Parents</div>
        <div class="audience-name">Seeking clarity for their children</div>
        <p class="audience-desc">Parents in Tamil Nadu often carry the weight of their child's future. Many seek an astrologer not to predict the future, but to feel heard and guided. Our report gives families a shared, grounded framework to discuss direction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="audience-card">
      <img class="audience-avatar"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Working professional"/>
      <div>
        <div class="audience-role">Professionals</div>
        <div class="audience-name">Navigating career transitions</div>
        <p class="audience-desc">Engineers, teachers, entrepreneurs - people mid-career who feel stuck, are considering a change, or need to understand why they feel unfulfilled despite external success. Our report often names what they already feel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="audience-card">
      <img class="audience-avatar"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621592484082-4b9d2a36e3b6?w=144&h=160&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Homemaker"/>
      <div>
        <div class="audience-role">Homemakers & Family-Focused</div>
        <div class="audience-name">Seeking inner clarity</div>
        <p class="audience-desc">Those who carry many roles - parent, caregiver, family pillar - often have the least space for their own reflection. Our report honours that role while opening space for personal goals, spiritual orientation, and individual direction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AI SECTION -->
<section class="ai-section">
  <div class="ai-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label" style="color:rgba(200,148,26,0.7);">The Technology</div>
      <h2 class="ai-title">Ancient knowledge,<br/><em>modern engine</em></h2>
      <p class="ai-body">Ask Astro Raja is powered by a large language AI model, carefully guided by a deeply crafted Vedic astrology system prompt built by our founder over months of study and refinement.</p>
      <p class="ai-body">The AI does not make up astrology. It applies a structured body of Vedic knowledge to your specific inputs - producing a reading that would take a human astrologer an hour to compose by hand.</p>
      <ul class="ai-points">
        <li>Your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra are the foundation - not decorative. Each combination produces a meaningfully different report.</li>
        <li>Your four intake answers shape the tone, focus, and recommendations. A student gets different guidance than an entrepreneur with the same Raasi.</li>
        <li>No two reports are identical. Every reading is generated fresh for you.</li>
        <li>Reports are available in PDF and Word format for easy sharing and reference.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-visual">
      <div class="ai-visual-title">How the Report is Built</div>
      <div class="ai-flow-step">
        <div class="ai-flow-num">01</div>
        <div class="ai-flow-label">
          <strong>Your Vedic Identity</strong>
          Raasi + Lagnam + Nakshatra fed into the AI engine
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-flow-step">
        <div class="ai-flow-num">02</div>
        <div class="ai-flow-label">
          <strong>Context Intake</strong>
          4 questions about your current struggles, life, goals and spiritual orientation
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-flow-step">
        <div class="ai-flow-num">03</div>
        <div class="ai-flow-label">
          <strong>AI Report Generation</strong>
          The Vedic system prompt processes all inputs and generates a structured personal report
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-flow-step">
        <div class="ai-flow-num">04</div>
        <div class="ai-flow-label">
          <strong>Formatted & Delivered</strong>
          Report formatted with clear sections, downloadable as PDF or Word
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TEAM -->
