  <h2 class="section-title">Built by people who <em>care</em></h2>
  <p class="section-sub">A small team from Tamil Nadu with a shared conviction: that meaningful astrology guidance should be accessible to every family, not just those who know the right astrologer.</p>
  <div class="team-grid">
    <div class="team-card">
