    </div>
    <div class="team-card">
      <img class="team-photo"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529626455594-4ff0802cfb7e?w=192&h=208&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Tech Lead"/>
      <div class="team-name">Kavitha M.</div>
      <div class="team-role">Product & Technology</div>
      <p class="team-bio">Full-stack developer and product designer. Built the web platform from the ground up with a focus on simplicity and performance for mobile users across Tamil Nadu.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="team-card">
      <img class="team-photo"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621592484082-4b9d2a36e3b6?w=192&h=208&fit=crop&crop=top"
        alt="Content Lead"/>
      <div class="team-name">Saranya R.</div>
      <div class="team-role">Content & Community</div>
      <p class="team-bio">Manages reader communications, report quality reviews, and the community of users who share feedback to help improve the guidance system over time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

